/// Cancels the deletion of a KMS key. When this operation succeeds, the key
/// state of the KMS key is Disabled . To enable the KMS key, use EnableKey
/// . For more information about scheduling and canceling deletion of a KMS
/// key, see Deleting KMS keys in the Key Management Service Developer Guide
/// . The KMS key that you use for this operation must be in a compatible
/// key state. For details, see Key states of KMS keys in the Key Management
