/// ImportKeyMaterial with your import token to import the key material. For
/// step-by-step instructions, see Importing Key Material in the Key
/// Management Service Developer Guide . You can import key material into
/// KMS keys of all supported KMS key types: symmetric encryption KMS keys,
/// HMAC KMS keys, asymmetric encryption KMS keys, and asymmetric signing
/// KMS keys. You can also create multi-Region keys with imported key
/// material. However, you can't import key material into a KMS key in a
/// custom key store. To create a multi-Region primary key with imported key
/// material, use the Origin parameter of CreateKey with a value of EXTERNAL
/// and the MultiRegion parameter with a value of True . To create replicas
